The titles follow a pattern: `[topic]: [context]中的[content type]`. The content types include:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - relevant\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - relevant\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - relevant\n- 专题观察 (topic observation) - about tech community activities, software history, developer interviews, team collaboration, industry culture - less relevant to the interest\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - about training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings - EXPLICITLY NOT wanted\n\nThe interest explicitly says: 不关注培训招生、证书宣传或求职薪资榜单 (does not care about training enrollment, certificate promotion, or salary ranking lists).\n\nSo I should exclude all \"市场观察\" (market observation) candidates since they contain training/certificate/salary content.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" (topic observation) candidates are about tech community activities, software history, developer interviews, team collaboration, industry culture. These are less directly relevant to the interest which focuses on database, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles.\n\nLet me identify the relevant candidates. The interest focuses on:\n- 数据库 (databases)\n- 并发 (concurrency)\n- 服务故障处理 (service fault handling)\n\nTopics present: 事务传播 (transaction propagation), 缓存失效 (cache invalidation), 任务取消 (task cancellation), 线程池排队 (thread pool queueing), 连接池等待 (connection pool waiting), 接口幂等 (interface idempotency), 组合索引 (composite index), 慢查询 (slow query), 消息重复 (message duplication), 并发更新 (concurrent update).\n\nThese all relate to databases, concurrency, and fault handling. Good.\n\nThe most relevant content types are: 概念速览, 操作记录, 条件与原理. These directly discuss implementation and principles.\n\nLet me count the candidates by content type to build a balanced collection of 20.\n\nLet me identify all candidates and their content types. I need to select 20 from the 80. Let me exclude 市场观察 (market observation) candidates entirely since they conflict with the explicit interest.\n\nLet me categorize. I'll go through the candidates:\n\n1. item-017f29068cff - 事务传播:内容管理接口中的专题观察 (topic observation)\n2. item-042e55d675a0 - 缓存失效:社区服务中的操作记录 (operation record)\n3. item-05526cd9d6f6 - 缓存失效:社区服务中的专题观察 (topic observation)\n4. item-07ad7c7c66a5 - 任务取消:内容管理接口中的条件与原理 (conditions/principles)\n5. item-07b1bd992c27 - 线程池排队:消息消费者中的概念速览 (concept overview)\n6. item-098771075993 - 连接池等待:内容管理接口中的操作记录 (operation record)\n7. item-0ac50d9f7f27 - 线程池排队:社区服务中的市场观察 (market - EXCLUDE)\n8. item-0af1c4827cd8 - 连接池等待:后台处理任务中的市场观察 (market - EXCLUDE)\n9. item-0b384ee33ac6 - 线程池排队:内容管理接口中的概念速览 (concept overview)\n10. item-0be6197962c6 - 接口幂等:内容管理接口中的市场观察 (market - EXCLUDE)\n11. item-0cf0da59e8f8 - 接口幂等:内容管理接口中的操作记录 (operation record)\n12. item-10482516c15c - 缓存失效:消息消费者中的市场观察 (market - EXCLUDE)\n13. item-1178ddd58b15 - 并发更新:社区服务中的市场观察 (market - EXCLUDE)\n14. item-140efafef8fc - 慢查询:后台处理任务中的概念速览 (concept overview)\n15. item-167782abe824 - 事务传播:内容管理接口中的条件与原理 (conditions/principles)\n16. item-1682f42295f8 - 并发更新:内容管理接口中的概念速览 (concept overview)\n17. item-16f7b9cc23ce - 连接池等待:消息消费者中的专题观察 (topic observation)\n18. item-17427e9b8667 - 缓存失效:社区服务中的概念速览 (concept overview)\n19. item-17c3bb0307b5 - 并发更新:后台处理任务中的条件与原理 (conditions/principles)\n20. item-1a7442187146 - 线程池排队:后台处理任务中的市场观察 (market - EXCLUDE)\n21. item-1ba5c7242ee5 - 连接池等待:后台处理任务中的操作记录 (operation record)\n22. item-1c3f785dd079 - 任务取消:内容管理接口中的市场观察 (market - EXCLUDE)\n23. item-1d10939960ab - 组合索引:社区服务中的专题观察 (topic observation)\n24. item-1d6434c1a27f - 消息重复:消息消费者中的操作记录 (operation record)\n25. item-20bfb5d44845 - 连接池等待:消息消费者中的条件与原理 (conditions/principles)\n26. item-258baaba2425 - 慢查询:消息消费者中的专题观察 (topic observation)\n27. item-2c20f0a4b41e - 事务传播:后台处理任务中的专题观察 (topic observation)\n28. item-31156631e3f2 - 接口幂等:社区服务中的条件与原理 (conditions/principles)\n29. item-326a31675f38 - 接口幂等:后台处理任务中的操作记录 (operation record)\n30. item-32e7f1169374 - 慢查询:内容管理接口中的概念速览 (concept overview)\n31. item-3356f301eff1 - 事务传播:消息消费者中的市场观察 (market - EXCLUDE)\n32. i